P(X = 0) = \binom{6}{0} \frac{1}{64} = \frac{1}{64}
\]
\[
P(X = 1) = \binom{6}{1} \frac{1}{64} = \frac{6}{64} = \frac{3}{32}
\]
So, \[
P(X \geq 2) = 1 - \frac{1}{64} - \frac{3}{32} = 1 - \frac{1}{64} - \frac{6}{64} = 1 - \frac{7}{64} = \frac{57}{64}
\]
